survival-fortran
================

This project contains a modern Fortran translation of computational routines
from R package survival 3.8-9. The survival-derived translation is provided
under LGPL-2.0-or-later, matching the upstream DESCRIPTION declaration
"LGPL (>= 2)".

The local dependency vendor/splines-fortran-v0.1.0 is GPL-2.0-or-later and
retains its own copyright/license notices. The linked default FPM target is
therefore distributed under GPL-2.0-or-later compatible terms.

No endorsement by the upstream authors or the R project is implied.
